SEMamba++ upstream (https://github.com/Eddieyjlee/SEMambapp, commit
cd369c89a8106072c077b468417b765b227afd74) does not ship a license file.
The Hugging Face weight card is marked GPL-2.0; that marking is not treated
here as permission to copy the upstream Python sources.

This package is an independent reconstruction of the published configuration
(16 kHz, n_fft 400, hop 100, hidden size 48, four bottleneck stages, magnitude
compression 0.3) and of the checkpoint's module names. The selective state-space
step follows the Mamba recurrence (Apache-2.0, state-spaces/mamba), implemented
in PyTorch. The optional fused backend calls that library's `mamba_inner_fn`
and Triton RMSNorm on CUDA; the default does not require it. The independent
network is not copied from the official SEMamba++ implementation.
